        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "King George Island to Punta Arenas"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "9305888e1012d4a4e809c03758ff00b2990ce69a608eadad47820f9fc35f66c2",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-f8804ba1-147d-4106-9470-50bbc2568386",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "Today’s plan includes a trip to Elefanteras, an elephant seal colony in the Drake Passage area.\n\nYou’ll also visit China’s Great Wall Station. Depending on the weather, other accessible sites may be added. The decision is made on the spot.\n\nAfter the programme, fly back to Punta Arenas.\n\n**The entire programme is weather-dependent.** Weather affects flights, landings, boat trips and access to individual sites."
